{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44306375/95e49ea9bc6acb600307df48967e5ca8d4c0d33c.png
We're thrilled to announce the launch of our updated demo for Sigilfarer! 🎲

Some of you might remember our previous demo, but as our game has evolved, we wanted to ensure that the demo reflects the latest mechanics and the fun of the current version. Dive in and experience the changes firsthand! 

What's changed? 🤔
- updated engine to UE 5.5;
- DLSS4;
- added hotkeys for dice in combat;
- added a new tutorial (it's more interactive, no more walls of text);
- tweaked UI;
- tweaked performance;
- locked dice will move to the next turn;
- you can't heal your characters (in combat) beyond the HP you enter the fight with;
- tweaked system and display of items that affect the dice to make it more clear;
- changes in configurations, loot, and items;
- other bugfixes and minor tweaks.

But that's not all! 
🎲 Kickstarter Campaign is now Live! 🎲
[previewyoutube=DWxSxq2CtPM;full][previewyoutube=neZSwNz5VGs;full][/previewyoutube][/previewyoutube]

In the first 48 hours, there are special deals that only last a certain amount of time, like Early Bird pledges or an exclusive set of in-game clothing for your character that won't be available after this period!

In addition to the game, our Kickstarter campaign offers a variety of digital and physical goods, available only during the campaign. These include a digital soundtrack, an in-game caravan skin, and even dice trays and dice sets! 🎲

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44306375/088346d56d6f9a2767a1249c7d7af7f5e6e54e8b.png
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44306375/358baa10e739be8246d451498d33ddd6dc29a81f.png

We'd love to hear your thoughts on the demo, so please let us know what you think. Join our Discord community, and follow us on X and TikTok to stay updated. If you enjoy the demo, it would mean the world to us if you could spread the word about Sigilfarer. Thank you!

